flowchart LR
  A[Ingest provider signals] --> B[Normalize canonical evidence]
  B --> C{Evidence qualified}
  C -- no --> Q[Quarantine and record reasons]
  C -- yes --> D[Project idempotently to Neo4j]
  D --> E[Create graph revision and subgraph digest]
  E --> F[Assess failure paths impact SLO and recovery options]
  F --> G[Generate bounded provider neutral candidates]
  G --> H{OPA policy decision}
  H -- deny --> Z[Record denial and escalate]
  H -- approval required --> I[Human approval]
  I -- reject or expire --> Z
  I -- approve --> J[Issue signed bounded authorization]
  H -- allow --> J
  J --> K[Execute through provider adapter with idempotency key]
  K --> L[Run ordered cross layer validation]
  L -- fail --> M[Compensate stop or escalate]
  M --> L
  L -- pass stable window --> N[Confirm recovered customer outcome]
  N --> O[Create DecisionEnvelope and evidence package]
  O --> P[Governed learning and improvement]
